        "Content": "Hallway - 2.67m x 4.35m\nWith tiled flooring and Cloak Room.\n\nSitting Room - 6.32m x 6.13m\nSpacious Sitting Room with open fire place, laminate timber flooring anf French doors to Living Room.\n\nLiving Room - 6.74m x 5.81m\nLarge Living Room with open fire place, laminate timber flooring and French doors to rear Garden, Sitting Room, Sun Room and Kitchen / Dining Room.\n\nSun Room - 3.85m x 4.38m\nBright Sun Room with tiled flooring and French doors to Living Room and rear Garden.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 9.42m x 5.00m\nLarge open plan Kitchen / Dining Room, with tiled / laminate timber flooring, modern fitted Kitchen and French doors to Living Room.\n\nRear Porch - 2.35m x 1.94m\nWith tiled flooring and access to rear Garden.\n\nWC - 2.38m x 1.56m\nWith W.C, W.H.B and tiled flooring.\n\nUtility Room - 2.69m x 3.59m\nWith tiled flooring, fitted storage and plumbed for washing machine / dryer.\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.34m x 5.14m\nSpacious ground floor Bedroom with En-Suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.43m x 3.59m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, shower and tiled flooring.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 3.33m x 1.64m\nWith Hotpress and Attic Stira.\n\nLanding - 3.33m x 2.11m\nWith Hotpress and Attic Stira.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.78m x 5.31m\nSpacious Master Bedroom with Walk-through Wardrobe and En-Suite.\n\nWalk-through Wardrobe - 2.28m x 3.55m\nIdeal for storage.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.45m x 2.68m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, shower and tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.77m x 4.97m\nBright Bedroom with laminate timber flooring and En-Suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.45m x 1.78m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, shower and tiled flooring.\n\nBathroom - 3.21m x 3.42m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, shower, bath and tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.73m x 5.17m\nLarge Bedroom with laminate timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.29m x 5.14m\nFront-facing Bedroom with laminate timber flooring.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nGarage - 7.70m x 6.67m\nIdeal for storage.\n\nGlass House - 5.26m x 2.92m"
